==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|LL.|en}} {{term|incisio|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɪnˈsɪʒn/|lang=en}}
*: {{rhymes|ɪʒən}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[cut]], especially one made by a [[scalpel]] or similar medical tool in the context of [[surgery|surgical]] [[operation]].
# The act of incising, or cutting into a substance.
#: {{rfquotek|Milton}}
# {{context|obsolete|lang=en}} Separation or solution of viscid matter by medicines.

